PackageIdentifier: RafaeFarrukh.anidash
PackageVersion: {version}
PackageLocale: en-US
Publisher: Muhammad Rafae Farrukh
PublisherUrl: https://github.com/rafaefarrukh
PublisherSupportUrl: https://github.com/rafaefarrukh/anidash/issues
PrivacyUrl: https://github.com/rafaefarrukh/anidash/blob/main/docs/code-signing-policy.md#privacy-policy
Author: Muhammad Rafae Farrukh
PackageName: anidash
PackageUrl: https://github.com/rafaefarrukh/anidash
License: MIT
LicenseUrl: https://github.com/rafaefarrukh/anidash/blob/main/LICENSE
ShortDescription: Follows your AniList Watching list and downloads new episodes from Nyaa automatically.
Description: |-
  anidash follows your AniList Watching list. When a new episode airs, it finds the release you prefer on Nyaa,
  downloads it with its built-in BitTorrent engine, saves it as <Library>/<Title>/<Title> - 05.mkv, updates your
  AniList progress and moves the file to the Recycle Bin after 30 days.
Moniker: anidash
Tags:
- anime
- anilist
- nyaa
- torrent
